    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battleboat</strong> \u2013 Prepare to test your strategic skills in a single-player showdown against a cunning(little bit) CPU opponent. <strong>Battleboat</strong> offers an interactive experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/43c553d4e75d8ead3bd34b717587f644.avif?t=1746785534\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Single-Player combat:</strong> Engage in tactical battles against the CPU which adapts its strategy after every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Diverse Fleet:</strong> Command a variety of ship types \u2013 from sleek boat and robust cruiser to formidable destroyer \u2013 each with its own unique placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Interactive Graphical Interface:</strong> Enjoy a visually simple and non-bloated interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Smart CPU Logic:</strong> Watch as the AI analyzes your ship placements and makes calculated moves to try and outsmart you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the battle and master the art of tactical warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/b1d9edca422f3a8ea7e70b4f7072ef87.avif?t=1746785534\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battleboat</strong> \u2013 Prepare to test your strategic skills in a single-player showdown against a cunning(little bit) CPU opponent. <strong>Battleboat</strong> offers an interactive experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/43c553d4e75d8ead3bd34b717587f644.avif?t=1746785534\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Single-Player combat:</strong> Engage in tactical battles against the CPU which adapts its strategy after every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Diverse Fleet:</strong> Command a variety of ship types \u2013 from sleek boat and robust cruiser to formidable destroyer \u2013 each with its own unique placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Interactive Graphical Interface:</strong> Enjoy a visually simple and non-bloated interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Smart CPU Logic:</strong> Watch as the AI analyzes your ship placements and makes calculated moves to try and outsmart you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the battle and master the art of tactical warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/b1d9edca422f3a8ea7e70b4f7072ef87.avif?t=1746785534\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
